---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Youth Circus & Acrobatics Workshop — Ilian Simeonow"  description="Youth circus and acrobatics workshop with Ilian Simeonow. Juggling, acrobatics, diabolo for children, young people and families." heroImage="/images/comedy-acting/Tommy.jpg">

  <div class="page-hero page-hero--workshop">
    <div class="hero-top-bar"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="section-label">// Workshop · 03</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Workshop<br /><span style="color: var(--orange);">Youth Circus</span></h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Acrobatics · Juggling · Circus · Family</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="article-section">
    <div class="article-grid">
      <div class="article-body">
        <p class="article-intro">
          Ilian brings children's dreams to life. In the Youth Circus workshop, children, young people and their parents learn juggling, acrobatics, diabolo and much more — through play, safely, and with a lot of fun.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">The Idea</h2>
        <p>My aim is to make children's dreams come alive and show them that they, as individuals, are part of the cultural fabric of society. This cultural-pedagogical work counters our media-saturated world with artistic variety and creative possibility.</p>
        <p>Children, young people and adults get to know themselves and their abilities in a new way through playful exercises and group games. It is also a wonderful opportunity for children and parents to share an experience together.</p>
        <p>Circus arts play a role far beyond the big top — they underpin gymnastics, rock'n'roll and breakdance, and form the foundation of modern extreme sports such as free climbing, parkour and skateboarding.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">Who Is This Workshop For?</h2>
        <p>Primarily aimed at children and young people and their parents — but actors too can only benefit from a solid grounding in circus arts. Whether you are a brave beginner or more advanced, you will learn something new.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">What Will You Learn?</h2>
        <p>Key elements of the course:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li><strong>Devilstick & Diabolo</strong> — classic circus props</li>
          <li><strong>Juggling</strong> — with balls, hoops and clubs</li>
          <li><strong>Children's Gymnastics & Partner Acrobatics</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Plate Spinning</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Endurance & Reaction</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Stretching</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Coordination Training</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <p>No prior experience is required. All equipment is provided.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">What to Bring</h2>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Comfortable clothing</li>
          <li>Indoor sports shoes</li>
          <li>Good mood</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-callout">
          <div class="section-label">// Pricing & Booking</div>
          <p>All prices plus VAT and travel costs (€0.30/km). Suitable for larger groups, schools, clubs and children's birthday parties. Non-binding offer on request.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="link-more">Get in Touch →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="article-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-label">// Other Workshops</div>
        <nav class="sidebar-nav">
          <a href="/en/workshops/fencing/" class="sidebar-link">Stage Fencing Workshop</a>
          <a href="/en/workshops/stunt/" class="sidebar-link">Stunt Workshop</a>
        </nav>
        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
          <div class="sidebar-label">// Booking</div>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px;">Book a workshop or request an offer — Ilian responds personally.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn-primary" style="display: block; text-align: center;">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 32px;">
          <div class="sidebar-label">// Knowledge</div>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px;">How to become an artist? Ilian explains the training paths.</p>
          <a href="/en/knowledge/how-to-artist/" class="btn-outline-orange" style="display: block; text-align: center; padding: 12px;">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>

</Layout>

<style>
.article-section { padding: var(--section-pad) var(--page-pad); background: var(--black); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.article-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
.article-intro { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.article-h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 24px; color: var(--white); font-weight: bold; margin: 40px 0 16px; }
.article-body p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-list { margin: 16px 0 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.article-list li { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); padding-left: 20px; position: relative; }
.article-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 9px; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); }
.article-list li strong { color: var(--white); }
.article-callout { background: var(--card); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); padding: 28px 24px; margin-top: 48px; }
.article-callout p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-sidebar { position: sticky; top: 88px; }
.sidebar-label { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.sidebar-nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: var(--border); }
.sidebar-link { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--card); display: block; transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
.sidebar-link:hover { color: var(--white); background: var(--black); }
</style>
